WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.350
Jerusalem, at Passover.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.450
Pilgrims flood the city.

3
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.990
Days earlier, Jesus rode
in on a young donkey.

4
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:12.490
People spread cloaks and branches
on the road, shouting Hosanna.

5
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.540
Now, in an upper room, he
takes bread, blesses it,

6
00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:19.240
breaks it, and gives it to his friends.

7
00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:21.460
He calls the bread his body.

8
00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:26.010
Then, over a cup, he speaks of
his blood of the new covenant.

9
00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:29.710
So why do Christians still
disagree about what he meant?

10
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.150
In this mission, you'll follow
the last days in Jerusalem,

11
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.700
from the entry on a donkey to the meal.

12
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:40.100
Then you'll compare what different
churches believe happens at the Eucharist.

13
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:45.170
Your mission: find out why Christians
still disagree about what Jesus meant.
